Hi all,

I’m happy to say rNOMADS 2.5.0 “Captain Trips” is finally on CRAN!  Windows and Mac OS binaries should be available there soon too.  Please upgrade when you have a chance.

However a user just pointed out a problem this morning.  Setting “depth” to greater than 1 causes the CrawlModels function to fail.  I am looking into it and will issue a fix soon.

Sorry for the rapid version turnover.  I think NOAA has been updating their website quite a bit lately and it’s causing problems.

Best,

Danny
